{t: Third Stone From The Sun}
{st: Jimi Hendrix}
{key: E}
{tempo: 120}

{sot: Intro}
| E7#9        | E7#9        | E7#9        | E7#9        |
{eot}

{sot: Theme}
| E7#9        | E7#9        | E7#9        | E7#9        |
| A7          | A7          | E7#9        | E7#9        |
| B7          | A7          | E7#9        | E7#9        |
{eot}

{sot: Bridge}
| E           | G           | A           | C     D     |
