{eot}

{sot: Solo}
| E7#9        | E7#9        | E7#9        | E7#9        |
{eot}

{sov: Notes}
Psychedelic Surf Jazz: Blends classic jazz-fusion harmony with heavy, spacey
surf-rock rhythms in E Mixolydian and E Blues.

Hendrix Chord: The main theme relies heavily on the signature E7#9 voicing
(77678x) coupled with fluid thumb-fretted basslines and octave lead fills.

Bridge Riff: The bridge shifts from the heavy blues-jazz feel into a driving
surf-rock riff walking up through E, G, A, C, and D major chords.

Texture and Whammy: Use liberal whammy bar dips, tape-delay feedback, and
unison string bends during the open solo and breakdown sections.
{eov}